{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:51:06+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:51:06+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"MLP SE","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"Germany","city":"Wiesloch","website":"https://mlp-se.com","employees":2583,"summary":"MLP SE, together with its subsidiaries, provides financial services in Germany. The company operates through Financial Consulting, Banking, FERI, DOMCURA, Industrial Broker, and Deutschland. It operates through Financial Consulting, Banking, FERI, DOMCURA, Industrial Broker, and Deutschland.Immobilien segments. The Financial Consulting segment offers consulting services for academics and other clients related to insurance, investments, and occupational pension provision schemes; and health and non-life insurance, real estate brokerage, wealth management, and loans and mortgages, as well as the brokering of contracts in financial services. The Banking segment provides banking services, such as accounts, credit cards, loans, and wealth management solutions. This segment also offers securities custody, commission, investment consulting, and investment brokerage services. The FERI segment provides wealth and investment consulting to institutional investors and high net worth individuals. The DOMCURA segment operates as an underwriting agency that designs, develops, and implements coverage concepts in the field of non-life insurance products, as well as provides brokerage services. The Industrial Broker segment offers consulting services and insurances for industrial and commercial clients, as well as the brokerage of insurance policies. The Deutschland.Immobilien segment engages in the brokering of real estate properties; and development and sale of real estate projects. The company provides its services under the Deutschland.Immobilien, DOMCURA, FERI, MLP, RVM and TPC brands for private, corporate, and institutional clients. MLP SE was founded in 1971 and is headquartered in Wiesloch, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"MLP SE, avec ses filiales, fournit des services financiers en Allemagne. La société opère par le biais de conseils financiers, bancaires, FERI, DOMCURA, courtier industriel et Deutschland. Elle opère à travers les segments Financial Consulting, Banking, FERI, DOMCURA, Industrial Broker et Deutschland.Immobilien."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1218865920,"shares_outstanding":109217377,"trailing_pe":17.714285,"forward_pe":13.693252,"price_to_book":2.0647547,"ev_to_ebitda":8.081,"ev_to_revenue":1.018,"dividend_yield":0.032,"payout_ratio":0.5714,"beta_yahoo":0.87},"targets":{"current_price":11.16,"mean":12.16,"median":13.0,"high":15.0,"low":8.8,"n_analysts":5,"reco_mean":1.2,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-26","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.2756,"institutions_pct":0.38278,"institutions_float_pct":0.52841,"institutions_n":53,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-DFA Intl Small Cap Value PORT.","pct":0.0117999995,"shares":1292363,"value":14422770,"date":"2025-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Series","pct":0.0043,"shares":466073,"value":5201374,"date":"2025-04-30","chg":-0.0066000004},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Intl Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.003,"shares":323179,"value":3606677,"date":"2025-04-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Dimensional ETF Trust-Dimensional International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0013,"shares":146572,"value":1635743,"date":"2025-04-30","chg":0.078099996},{"name":"WisdomTree Trust-WisdomTree International SmallCap Dividend Fund","pct":0.0008,"shares":85471,"value":953856,"date":"2025-06-30","chg":-0.1407},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DI